# Contributing to __NAME__

Bug reports and fixes are welcome. Open an issue first for anything larger.

- `cargo test` and `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` must pass.
- The look comes from [NCF](https://github.com/NativeCompute/ncf): use its components and tokens, never raw colours.
- A user's data is never changed or lost behind their back.

By contributing you agree that your contribution is licensed under the MIT licence.
